cone modulo $J^{\gp}$: $\sum_i Z_{S_i}/J^{\gp}$ pointed iff no relation
$\sum n_iz_i=0$... could fail. THE contractible variant (standard and
sufficient): the cover $\mathcal V_b$ \emph{containing the identity map}
$\mathrm{id}_{i(b)}$\ldots the atlas $\{S_v\}$ refined by the CFA cover of
$i(b)$—of which $\mathrm{id}$ is a member—and the refinement of a
refinement: final cover: $\mathcal V_b^{\sharp}:=\{i(b)\to S_v\otimes i(b)/K:
S_v\text{ tight},K\text{ face}\}$: contains identity ($S_v$, $K$ such that
